[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293932301","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3293932301","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3293932301,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EVWsN","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-15T20:58:32Z","updated_at":"2025-09-15T20:58:32Z","body":"@HolonProduction \r\n\r\n> But given how fragile the whole interaction between GDScript and the ResourceCache is at the moment, we should pass it in just in case.\r\n\r\nAre there any known issues to test this PR against?  I'd be curious to see if this PR improves on the stability","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3293932301/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3296633775","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3296633775","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3296633775,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EfqOv","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T08:38:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T08:38:26Z","body":"There are a bunch of issues about loading custom resources, that probably originate from some GDScript stuff. Some of the more deterministic ones are linked here: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109345\r\nHowever, I doubt that your PR will have much of an influence, GDScript loading goes through a secondary cache which has a global lock. So GDScripts are always loaded sequentially.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3296633775/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299404763","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3299404763","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3299404763,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EqOvb","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T15:57:16Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T15:57:16Z","body":"Started digging into why the integration tests are failing on this PR.  Here's my finding:\r\n\r\n1. It fails the integration test for suggestion animations ❌️\r\n2. When opening the scene though and testing manually, everything works fine ✅️\r\n\r\nAnd it only fails with this one.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299404763/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299600034","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3299600034","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3299600034,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Eq-ai","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T16:55:17Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T16:55:17Z","body":"The completion tests use `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP` when loading scenes. Maybe that has some sort of influence :thinking: But if that was broken there should be more failing tests methinks.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299600034/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299771156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3299771156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3299771156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EroMU","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T17:50:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T17:50:49Z","body":"> The completion tests use `CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP` when loading scenes. Maybe that has some sort of influence 🤔 But if that was broken there should be more failing tests methinks.\r\n\r\nOh shoot!  I think there may be a bug in the ``ResourceLoader`` here that my PR just revealed.\r\n\r\nThis here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/876b290332ec6f2e6d173d08162a02aa7e6ca46d/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L580-L587\r\n\r\nIt should be\r\n\r\n```cpp\r\n if (do_assign) { \r\n \tif (cache_mode != ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_IGNORE && cache_mode != ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_IGNORE_DEEP) { \r\n \t\tres->set_path(path, cache_mode == ResourceFormatLoader::CACHE_MODE_REPLACE); \r\n \t} else { \r\n \t\tres->set_path_cache(path); \r\n \t} \r\n \tres->set_scene_unique_id(id); \r\n } \r\n ```\r\n \r\n ## EDIT\r\n \r\n Nevermind, I don't believe this to be the case.  I think that is already handled here:\r\n \r\n https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/6efa557e9b77a4499519b4f5585c5f8f314afdfd/scene/resources/resource_format_text.cpp#L1391-L1406\r\n \r\n I will test nonetheless to see","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299771156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299795342","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3299795342","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3299795342,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EruGO","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T17:58:14Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T17:58:14Z","body":"As expected, that was not the issue.  Strange that it is specific to this integration test and all the others work.  I even stepped through the others in the debugger and they are working as expected.\r\n\r\nAnd even more strange that this test does work when manually testing it.  It is just the integration test that fails.\r\n\r\nMy guess is things are behaving properly, but that this integration test relies on the bug being present.  I suspect there is some lock contention going on and now the integration is being forced to wait for the entire initialization of the resource to complete whereas before it could grab it while it was still initialization.  Which would actually be the correct behavior.\r\n\r\nThe other theory is that I broke something.  It just isn't clear to me what when looking at my code change as the logic should be exactly the same.  Just the lock is held longer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3299795342/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300156164","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3300156164","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3300156164,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EtGME","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-16T19:56:22Z","updated_at":"2025-09-16T19:56:22Z","body":"Pending confirmation of the pipeline, all integration and unit tests should be working now!  PR is ready for further review :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3300156164/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301274494","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3301274494","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3301274494,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ExXN-","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-17T04:35:08Z","updated_at":"2025-09-17T04:35:08Z","body":"Looks like the unit tests and pipelines are passing now! Thank you @HolonProduction! That was an eagle eye'd catch you made! I'm very impressed! :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3301274494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3312729011","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3312729011","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3312729011,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FdDuz","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T15:53:03Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T15:53:03Z","body":"Just realized I need to add the same fix to ``resource_format_binary.cpp`` as well. Going to do that :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3312729011/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313734274","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3313734274","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3313734274,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fg5KC","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T20:33:57Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T20:33:57Z","body":"Fixed ``resource_format_binary.cpp`` and also introduced the parameter ``p_parent_path`` to ``ResourceLoader::_load``.  I'll add the reasoning to the issue description as well as this comment.\r\n\r\n``ResourceLoader::_load`` is also running into race conditions here:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/3c9d03b8755968ae305b8cfebe886c56402cb044/core/io/resource_loader.cpp#L294-L300\r\n\r\nThese lines work great for a synchronous situation.  However, in an async context, it is not gauranteed that the next task on the stack requires the current task to complete before it can run. It becomes especially problematic if multiple async load requests are made for packed scenes with the same dependencies.  A situation such as this (my particular case) can arise.\r\n\r\nSay we have a scene setup such as this:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsunglasses.tscn\r\n|-- sunglasses.glb\r\n```\r\n\r\nand then I have multiple inherited scenes such as:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsunglasses_red.tscn (inherits sunglasses.tscn)\r\n|-- sunglasses.glb\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nsunglasses_blue.tscn (inherits sunglasses.tscn)\r\n|-- sunglasses.glb\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nsunglasses_green.tscn (inherits sunglasses.tscn)\r\n|-- sunglasses.glb\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd then I load all 3 asyncronously:\r\n\r\n```cs\r\n ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(\"res://sunglasses_red.tscn\");\r\n ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(\"res://sunglasses_blue.tscn\");\r\n ResourceLoader.LoadThreadedRequest(\"res://sunglasses_green.tscn\");\r\n ```\r\n\r\nAnd this is where it gets interesting. A rare (but possible as in my case) situation can arise that results in a stack overflow crash.  It goes like this:\r\n\r\n```\r\n\"res://sunglasses_red.tscn\" gets added to loading tasks\r\n\"res://sunglasses.tscn\" gets added to loading tasks. Registers with \"res://sunglasses_red.tscn\" as subtask \r\n\"res://sunglasses.glb\" gets added to loading tasks. Registers with \"res://sunglasses.tscn\" as subtask\r\nloader checks for any q'd load requests\r\n\"res://sunglasses_blue.tscn\" gets added to loading tasks. Registers with \"res://sunglasses.glb\" as subtask\r\n\"res://sunglasses_blue.tscn\" and \"res://sunglasses.glb\" call each other's load methods recursively until stack overflow\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe solution:\r\n\r\nPass ``p_parent_path`` to ``ResourceLoader::_load`` so we know for sure who to register subtasks with rather than trying to infer based on the current stack.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313734274/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330107218","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3330107218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3330107218,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7GfWdS","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-24T18:11:06Z","updated_at":"2025-09-24T18:11:06Z","body":"Just got done adding an additional fix and left an explanation in \"Edit 2\" of the PR description","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3330107218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3878467855","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110538#issuecomment-3878467855","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110538","id":3878467855,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7nLLkP","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github